		(property "Notes" "USB-side bulk, polymer (no DC-bias loss). 100 uF (was 68 uF, review 2 B-5): MLCCs keep only ~6 uF each at 20 V, so 68 uF left 72-75 uF worst case vs the BQ25756 80 uF minimum after derating; now ~99 uF. Same 6.3 mm footprint, 7.7 mm tall. Check ESR/ripple in the maker datasheet (not listed at JLC)"
