		(property "Notes" "CE pull-up to 3V3: charging is inhibited unless the MCU drives CHG_INH low (reset, hang, unprogrammed or Standby all inhibit). With 3V3 down (dead pack) CE reads low, so USB can still revive the pack. MCU low through R435: CE = 3.3 x 1k/48k = 0.07 V (VIL max 0.4 V)"
			(at 0 0 90)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
